---
name: Onboard Cisco ASA logs via syslog TCP
description: |
  Receives Cisco Secure Firewall ASA logs over TCP syslog, newline-delimited or
  octet-counted, parses them, and publishes the events to the `cisco` topic.
---

accept_tcp "0.0.0.0:1470" {
  // ASA writes local times without a zone, except in the RFC 5424 format.
  cisco::asa::read timezone="Europe/Berlin"
}
publish "cisco"
